	(text "USB 2.0 HIGH-SPEED INTERFACE (FT2232H, bus powered)\nCh A: 245 synchronous FIFO (EEPROM-configured), 60 MHz FT_CLK, ~35-40 MB/s to host.\nCh B: MPSSE for SPI flash programming + FPGA reset (iceprog -I B pinout:\n  BD0 SCK, BD1 MOSI, BD2 MISO, BD4 CS, BD6 CDONE, BD7 CRESET_B).\nCh B is usable only while Ch A is NOT in sync-FIFO mode (program first, then stream).\nU503 93LC56 (x16, ORG=VCC) holds FTDI config. J501 shield to GND via 1M || 4.7nF."
		(at 185.42 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c93f0f4e-9ec8-4004-a2f3-6eb6345d8d80")
	)
